    "slug": "before-the-scream",
    "title": "Before the Scream",
    "category": "original",
    "year": 2026,
    "description": {
      "zh": "为 Jump Scare 前逐渐累积的紧张感而创作的弦乐作品。作品弱化明确旋律与调性，通过音色、音域、不协和音程与声响密度的变化建立不稳定的音响空间，并运用 Artificial Harmonics、Sul ponticello、Tritone、Minor 2nd 以及局部 Controlled Aleatory，使心理压力随时间逐渐增加。",
      "en": "A string piece composed to build tension before a jump scare. Clear melody and tonality are downplayed; changes in timbre, register, dissonant intervals and sound density create an unstable sonic space. Artificial harmonics, sul ponticello, tritones, minor seconds and passages of controlled aleatory gradually increase psychological tension."
    },
