    "title": "The Enchanted Box",
    "category": "original",
    "year": 2023,
    "description": {
      "zh": "以绘本般的 Fantasy 场景为想象背景创作的木管四重奏。作品从 Octatonic Scale 构建动机，通过动机发展、声部间的传递与模仿以及对位处理展开，并利用四种木管乐器不同的音色与音域，营造逐渐展开的温和、幻想性世界。",
      "en": "A woodwind quartet inspired by a picture-book-like fantasy scene. Motifs drawn from the octatonic scale unfold through development, exchange and imitation between parts, and contrapuntal writing. The contrasting timbres and registers of the four woodwinds create a gentle fantasy world that gradually opens up."
    },
