    "title": "Beyond the Horizon",
    "category": "original",
    "year": 2022,
    "description": {
      "zh": "为宏大影像场景创作的管弦乐作品。从抒情而开阔的主题逐渐发展至具有战斗行进感的紧张段落，并通过多次转调、节奏变化以及共同旋律动机的持续发展与变形，在不同音乐情绪之间保持整体统一。",
      "en": "An orchestral piece composed for a large-scale visual scene. A lyrical, expansive theme gradually develops into a tense passage with the character of a battle march. Repeated modulations, rhythmic changes and the continuing development and transformation of shared melodic motifs maintain unity across different musical moods."
